-- Standards: more sports, and the energy group taken out
--  * 65 more sports (indoor and outdoor) with Class I / II / III values after EN 12193:2018 – average horizontal
--    illuminance, uniformity and Ra. Sports EN 12193 does not list (elle, kabaddi, sepak takraw, carrom, padel, pickleball)
--    carry values by analogy with the nearest listed sport and say so. The Sports group is marked for the Design
--    Manager's review.
--  * The energy group (SLSEA lighting power density – values were never entered) is removed from Standards; DLux no
--    longer shows a W/m² limit.

